WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.400
Everyone has ideas for AI.

2
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:04.604
Few teams know which ones are worth doing.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.683
What's missing isn't ideas.

4
00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:11.580
It's a plan, an owner, and people to do
the work.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:18.198
We find where AI pays off in your
business, and then we make it happen.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.907
In week one, we talk to your teams and see
where the hours really go.

7
00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:26.197
Like orders that get typed in by hand.

8
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.684
Over the next two weeks, every idea gets
ranked,

9
00:00:30.684 --> 00:00:33.364
so you know what to do first and what can
wait.

10
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.205
The result is a ninety day roadmap,

11
00:00:38.205 --> 00:00:41.448
simple enough for your leadership to read
and approve.

12
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:44.646
Then we put it to work.

13
00:00:44.796 --> 00:00:49.186
We automate two or three processes end to
end, and train your team to run them.

14
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.834
After that, we can stay on as your Head of
AI, a few days a month.

15
00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.892
Start with a clear picture.

16
00:01:00.042 --> 00:01:02.342
Book a call at sandboxinnovate.com.

